.DS_Store

# There is no build step and no dependencies — nothing here should create this.
# Kept as a guard so a stray `npm i` while poking at a tool can't commit 40MB.
node_modules/

# Source material the migration reads FROM. The shipped copies live in seed/,
# already resized, and those ARE committed — seed/ is what the app ships with.
# These are the originals: 340MB of full-resolution art and camera JPEGs that
# would be in every clone forever and are backed up outside this repo.
#
# Every one of these is anchored with a leading slash, and it matters. An
# unanchored `moodboard/` matches at ANY depth, so it also swallowed
# seed/media/moodboard/ — 145 images the app cannot run without, silently
# absent from the repo. Same trap for marginalia/.
/moodboard/
/marginalia/
/compositions/
/design inspo for claude/
/art/
/_source-photos/
